        <p>For instance, we had a customer who routinely rented the <a href="https://vac2go.com/vactor-2100-plus-combination-unit/">Vactor 2100 Plus Combination Unit</a>, but for a different type of job that customer decided to go with the <a href="https://vac2go.com/gapvax-mc1510-combination-unit/">GapVax MC 1510</a>, which offers different features. We have staff who were able to train the customer quickly on the ins and outs of the GapVax to ensure a smooth transition and to make sure the customer gets the most out of each brand going forward.</p>
        <p>In a general sense, we know that any of our trucks will only be as effective as the person operating it, which is why we strive to make sure our customers know how to operate the truck properly, from front to back &#8211; and it&#8217;s why we offer <em>free</em> training for every rental that goes out the door.</p>
        <p>And not only do we offer this training and make it available and flexible for our customers, we have expert staff available 24/7, in case you are on a job after hours and need help. In those situations, Vac2Go can walk you through any problems to ensure you get the most out of the equipment. (Check with the competition &#8211; they&#8217;re not always available the way we are.)</p>
        <p>A few of the specific training services we offer are:</p>
