        <p>And we will be happy to discuss your specific needs to help you decide which truck offers the right features and equipment for the job you want to get done, figure out the accessories you may need, inform you how to work the truck, etc. And that&#8217;s in addition to the 24/7 availability during your Vac2Go rental. Consider us your &#8220;one-stop shop&#8221; when it comes to getting the most out of your rental and getting the job done right &#8211; the first time.</p>
